  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "The choices are always er, ir, and ur, in that order. Never add, drop, or reorder them.",
      "Put exactly one gap token from allowed_extra_words in the stem. The hyphen is only the missing er, ir, or ur.",
      "Joining the correct choice to the gap must spell one real word. The other two joins must not be real words.",
      "The sentence must fit that one word only. If the gap is t-n, the sentence must mean turn.",
      "Do not leave a finished word that contains er, ir, or ur, or that spelling gives the answer away.",
      "Use only roots word-list words, allowed gap tokens, and <NAME>. Keep every stem at ten words or under.",
      "Stay in school, home, food, pets, play, family, and weather. No brands and no real names.",
      "When the stem has <NAME>, set that item swap_slots NAME to names.txt.",
      "A target word may repeat later, but every stem sentence must be new.",
      "Use whole words and the letter patterns er, ir, and ur only. No sound symbols and no audio file names.",
      "If you add media, the lemma is the completed word. Never describe a picture in the stem."
    ]
  },
